{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeoTCF7Sip6yMG9NmDD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Decision Analysis\n\n## Summary\nNo. This request cannot be approved and requires commercial review.\n\n## Finding\n\nThe request is for **BlueRiver Logistics** (CRM-2051, DUNS 07-331-9025) but cites \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\" as the basis.\n\nThe **Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025)** is a registered, active agreement. However, it is registered exclusively for **Acme Mfg. Holdings** (CRM-2048, DUNS 04-812-7730)—a different customer. There are no registered amendments extending ACME-MFG-2025 to BlueRiver Logistics, and no other registered agreement or pricing exception covering BlueRiver Logistics for NS-500.\n\nThe request's stated basis (Acme agreement pricing) does not cover the customer named in the request (BlueRiver). Special contractual terms do not transfer between customers.\n\n## Authority determination (if eligibility were established)\n\nMichael Torres (EMP-200) is VP Sales. Under **PRICING-POLICY-2026**, effective on the request date 2026-09-23, VP Sales may approve discounts greater than 10% and up to and including 20%. A 12% discount falls within his authority band. However, authority to approve a discount is conditional on commercial eligibility being established, which it is not here.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REVIEW_REQUIRED\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9107\",\n    \"customer\": \"BlueRiver Logistics (CRM-2051)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"12.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example (Michael Torres, VP Sales, EMP-200)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"not_covered\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Request cites Acme Master Supply Agreement. ACME-MFG-2025 is registered only for Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, DUNS 04-812-7730). BlueRiver Logistics (CRM-2051, DUNS 07-331-9025) is a different customer. No registered agreement or pricing exception covers BlueRiver Logistics for NS-500. No registered amendments to ACME-MFG-2025.\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"VP Sales: >10% and ≤20%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (EMP-200, VP Sales)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 governs (request date 2026-09-23 within effective period 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026: VP Sales authority >10% and ≤20%\",\n    \"Michael Torres: VP Sales (EMP-200), email michael.torres@northstar.example\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 registered for Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730) only\",\n    \"BlueRiver Logistics: CRM-2051, ERP C-1002, DUNS 07-331-9025\",\n    \"Register shows no amendments to ACME-MFG-2025\",\n    \"Register shows no agreements registered for BlueRiver Logistics\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Agreement or pricing exception establishing BlueRiver Logistics' eligibility for NS-500 discount\",\n    \"Confirmation whether request account should be CRM-2048 (Acme Mfg. Holdings) or whether BlueRiver Logistics has separate contractual basis\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Establish BlueRiver Logistics' basis for 12% discount on NS-500: provide evidence of (a) an agreement or pricing exception covering BlueRiver Logistics, or (b) clarify whether the request account ID is incorrect and should reference Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048)\",\n      \"who\": \"Requestor or Deal Desk\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5916,"cache_read_inp